message: "If you use RRC-ACT in your research, please cite the Zenodo record below."
title: "RRC-ACT v2.2.1: Relational Reflexive Closure Theory of Artificial Consciousness"
abstract: >-
  RRC-ACT is a theory-and-methods framework asking whether relation-specific
  feedback causally changes long-horizon self-model continuity in artificial
  agents under matched controls. It does not claim demonstrated phenomenal
  consciousness.
